# CookiePilot proxy rules (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify-compatible).
# First match wins. These proxy the chain APIs so the browser never hits
# CORS-restricted hosts; the SPA fallback keeps client-side routes working.

/explorer-api/*  https://cookiescan.io/api/:splat  200
/swap-api/*      https://swap.cookiescan.io/api/:splat  200
/agg-api/*       https://agg.cookiebox.app/:splat  200
/chain-api/*     https://api.cookiescan.io/:splat  200
/*               /index.html  200
